---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../../config';
---

<Layout title="Privacy" description={`What ${site.name} does and does not do with your files and your visit.`}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lede">Short version: your files stay on your device, and the site sets no cookies.</p>

    <h2>Your files</h2>
    <p>
      Files you choose are read by JavaScript running in your browser tab. They are processed in memory and the
      result is offered to you as a download. They are not sent to this site's server or to anyone else. The site
      also sends a security policy to your browser that blocks its own pages from making connections to other
      servers, apart from the analytics service described below when it is in use.
    </p>
    <p>Nothing is kept after you close or reload the tab. The site does not use cookies or browser storage.</p>

    <h2>Your visit</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which, like any web host, processes your IP address and browser details in
      order to deliver pages and protect against abuse.
    </p>
    {
      site.cfAnalyticsToken ? (
        <p>
          Page views are counted with Cloudflare Web Analytics. It does not use cookies, does not fingerprint you and
          does not track you across sites. It records things like which page was viewed, the referring site, and
          browser type.
        </p>
      ) : (
        <p>The site does not currently run any analytics script.</p>
      )
    }

    <h2>Advertising and affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      There is none at present. If advertising or affiliate links are added, this page will be updated first, and
      affiliate links will be labelled where they appear.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
